WEBVTT

00:18.110 --> 00:22.370
<i>Is okay for me to be here?</i>

00:24.460 --> 00:27.920
<b>Torpedo 
Squadron 2</b>

00:28.490 --> 00:29.720
<i>I...</i>

00:36.300 --> 00:41.380
<i>I'm glad I got to meet the admiral... 
and everyone else.</i>

01:08.920 --> 01:13.940
<i>I'll do what I can do, as best I can.</i>

01:16.410 --> 01:17.640
<i>Watch me, okay?</i>

01:20.680 --> 01:25.980
<b>See You Again on Another Quiet Blue Sea</b>

01:29.610 --> 01:34.200
<i>So... So, please... Remember me.</i>

01:42.220 --> 01:43.460
<i>And...</i>

01:52.770 --> 01:54.110
<i>I'll be back soon.</i>

02:01.970 --> 02:07.230
<b></b>Three Months Ago
 Kure Naval District

02:09.330 --> 02:12.190
Large enemy bomber formation 
approaching Kure!

02:14.790 --> 02:18.170
Enemy attack! Prepare to intercept aircraft!

02:26.050 --> 02:28.160
Type 3 Shells! Fire!

02:47.520 --> 02:48.470
Are you okay, Haruna?!

02:48.830 --> 02:50.100
I'm okay!

02:57.320 --> 02:58.820
Haruna won't let you...

03:23.400 --> 03:24.900
Haruna, go!

03:27.880 --> 03:30.980
Get to Sasebo with Ooyodo 
and Carrier Division 4!

03:32.020 --> 03:33.230
That's right!

03:33.230 --> 03:36.940
We'll handle this with the 343!

03:49.910 --> 03:54.120
The 343rd Air Unit won't hold them for long!

03:54.120 --> 03:59.340
Get out of here while you can and 
catch up with Carrier Division 4!

04:03.260 --> 04:05.970
We'll gather all our 
remaining ships at Sasebo...

04:05.970 --> 04:08.810
Meet up with Yamato and Torpedo Squadron 2.

04:09.800 --> 04:12.140
It's time for our final operation!

04:20.730 --> 04:22.170
I'm counting on you.

04:24.410 --> 04:26.870
It'll take more than this to sink me!

04:31.710 --> 04:33.790
This is the Aoba!

04:34.680 --> 04:36.220
Ooicchi...

04:36.750 --> 04:39.610
Are you watching me, Chikuma?!

05:01.280 --> 05:05.740
<b></b>Three Days Ago 
Sasebo Naval District

05:06.170 --> 05:07.450
They're finally here?

05:24.200 --> 05:29.150
The enemy invasion fleet 
and carrier escort fleet

05:29.150 --> 05:30.830
have arrived at the Nansei islands...

05:42.570 --> 05:45.820
<b>Nansei Islands Absolute Defense Line</b>

05:46.280 --> 05:48.770
Iwakawa's Cotton Rose recon unit says...

05:48.770 --> 05:54.040
The sea around the Nansei 
islands is already turning red.

05:54.040 --> 05:55.540
They're coming.

05:55.540 --> 05:57.500
The admiral has arrived.

05:58.380 --> 06:00.000
At ease, at ease.

06:04.920 --> 06:07.000
This is our last carrier fleet.

06:07.380 --> 06:13.120
Our remaining carriers, as well as Carrier 
Division 4, Haruna, and Ooyodo's destroyers

06:13.120 --> 06:19.040
will launch a diversionary attack on 
the enemy fleet to attempt to lure them north.

06:29.240 --> 06:32.820
Torpedo Squadron 2 will 
form the 1st Striking Force

06:32.820 --> 06:36.640
alongside the second fleet, 
Yamato and Mogami.

06:37.200 --> 06:40.860
1st Striking Force will head straight for...

06:46.380 --> 06:49.670
Yamato, Mogami, and Torpedo Squadron 2

06:49.670 --> 06:53.360
will head straight for the enemy rear 
and break through their picket lines.

06:53.360 --> 06:58.350
We'll strike the enemy's transport 
and supply ships, wiping them out.

06:58.720 --> 07:03.690
Then if we still can, we'll turn around 
and engage the enemy's main force, right?

07:03.690 --> 07:05.070
Yup.

07:05.360 --> 07:05.700
Yes.

07:06.480 --> 07:11.030
The training you've done and the equipment 
you were given was all for this moment!

07:12.680 --> 07:17.740
You've all fought well 
in many difficult battles.

07:18.530 --> 07:21.180
I'm so grateful to all of you.

07:22.430 --> 07:25.030
And I believe in you!

07:28.890 --> 07:30.060
In the future!

07:34.260 --> 07:35.670
Come back safe.

07:37.670 --> 07:39.020
I'm counting on you!

07:41.730 --> 07:46.440
<b></b>Three Hours Ago
 Kyushu, Bounomisaki Gulf

08:04.160 --> 08:05.330
Let's go.

08:40.340 --> 08:41.820
It's time for us...

08:41.820 --> 08:43.410
...to go too, then.

08:47.750 --> 08:50.090
634th Air Unit Zuiuns...

08:50.090 --> 08:52.050
Take off!

09:11.050 --> 09:14.220
Yamato-san, it's up to you now.

09:15.610 --> 09:20.080
<b></b>One Hour Ago 
North of Kikaijima in the Nansei Islands

09:25.890 --> 09:29.480
Our carrier fleets' bombers have 
engaged the enemy carrier fleet!

09:29.480 --> 09:32.020
Multiple enemy ships in flames!

09:33.850 --> 09:35.440
They did it.

09:35.440 --> 09:36.470
Update!

09:36.470 --> 09:39.390
Multiple allied planes shot down!

09:39.390 --> 09:43.140
The survivors have rearmed and 
launched a second attack wave!

09:43.140 --> 09:46.990
A large formation of enemy planes is en route!

09:46.990 --> 09:50.270
I'm being told... "We pray for your success."

09:50.920 --> 09:52.110
Yamato!

09:52.690 --> 09:53.840
Roger.

09:57.110 --> 09:59.360
Thank you, Houshou-san.

10:05.290 --> 10:08.790
I will now take command 
of the surface strike fleet!

10:09.590 --> 10:13.000
1st Striking Force planes, take off!

10:15.330 --> 10:17.160
Mogami planes, take off!

10:19.690 --> 10:21.810
We strike at sunset!

10:21.810 --> 10:25.660
Yahagi's planes are to attack 
the enemy patrol ships to our front!

10:25.660 --> 10:29.600
Mogami and Yamato's planes are to 
strike the decks of the escort carriers.

10:29.600 --> 10:30.870
Roger!

10:31.560 --> 10:34.650
We will follow alongside the air attack.

10:34.650 --> 10:37.780
1st Striking Force, line ahead formation!

10:43.370 --> 10:45.240
Full speed ahead!

10:48.120 --> 10:49.310
Gure!

10:49.310 --> 10:50.330
Yuki!

10:50.690 --> 10:52.080
Attack!

11:04.470 --> 11:09.430
<b></b>Ten Minutes Ago
 Off Kikaijima in the Nansei Islands

11:39.440 --> 11:41.120
We're through their picket ships!

11:44.010 --> 11:46.730
Prepare main guns and torpedoes!

11:56.520 --> 12:00.280
Torpedo Squadron can still... 
we can still fight!

12:03.330 --> 12:05.370
I'm going on ahead, Yahagi-san.

12:06.200 --> 12:08.220
Opening fire with all main guns!

12:09.410 --> 12:10.880
Fire!

12:24.010 --> 12:25.440
Asashimo!

12:25.440 --> 12:27.020
Go on without me!

12:32.330 --> 12:33.430
Destroy them!

12:33.430 --> 12:34.690
Fire!

12:38.110 --> 12:41.440
Yahagi! Destroyer Division 41 
and I will protect Yamato!

12:41.440 --> 12:42.400
Roger!

12:45.610 --> 12:47.310
Torpedo Squadron 2 is ready!

12:47.850 --> 12:49.230
Entering combat!

12:52.050 --> 12:53.500
Take this!

13:02.380 --> 13:03.340
Yuki!

13:06.500 --> 13:07.300
I'm okay!

13:10.470 --> 13:12.430
Torpedo Squadron 2, ready torpedoes!

13:18.660 --> 13:19.730
Go!

13:20.230 --> 13:21.700
Fire!

13:33.670 --> 13:34.870
We're through!

13:35.370 --> 13:37.830
Enemy supply ships to our front!

13:37.830 --> 13:40.760
Torpedo Squadron 2, destroy every
last one of them!

14:02.860 --> 14:04.570
We got them!

14:05.180 --> 14:07.070
Now the enemy invasion will...

14:11.070 --> 14:12.520
Kasumi!

14:11.070 --> 14:12.520
Kasumi-san!

14:12.890 --> 14:14.470
I'm fine!

14:16.290 --> 14:18.290
You're not fine at all!

14:18.290 --> 14:22.750
I'll save Kasumi-san and Asashimo-san!

14:23.110 --> 14:24.410
Hatsushimo!

14:25.210 --> 14:27.670
Shigure-san, go!

14:34.940 --> 14:36.410
Yeah...

14:36.410 --> 14:37.600
Wait for me!

14:53.860 --> 14:56.230
Watch out... for collisions!

14:58.820 --> 15:01.700
Be on alert! Enemy carriers in range!

15:09.360 --> 15:10.550
No!

15:16.310 --> 15:17.810
Hamakaze!

15:18.770 --> 15:20.180
Isokaze!

15:21.250 --> 15:23.120
Is this the end?

15:33.490 --> 15:35.410
Enemy fleet is in sight!

15:35.410 --> 15:37.490
We will now provide support 
to our allied fleet.

15:39.540 --> 15:43.180
We can't let these seas remain
 red and stormy forever.

15:44.100 --> 15:45.650
We are an alliance.

15:45.650 --> 15:48.350
The Royal Navy has arrived to lend a hand.

15:55.450 --> 15:56.620
What...?

16:07.700 --> 16:10.050
Yes, of course!

16:10.050 --> 16:11.820
We won't let them beat us!

16:12.920 --> 16:14.130
Iowa?

16:16.410 --> 16:18.530
Can you still fight, Yah-mah-toh?

16:18.530 --> 16:20.040
Are you okay?

16:26.640 --> 16:28.580
Don't get in front of me!

16:28.580 --> 16:31.620
Shut up! Don't you get in front of me!

16:32.220 --> 16:34.830
When we beat the Abyssals, you're next!

16:34.830 --> 16:37.510
Fine! If you want a fight, you're on!

16:40.520 --> 16:41.550
Okay!

16:42.630 --> 16:45.230
Torpedo Squadron 2, form up again!

16:50.190 --> 16:54.780
<b></b>Three Minutes Ago
 In front of the Abyssal Carrier Fleet

16:54.780 --> 16:57.490
Line ahead! Prepare to break through!

16:57.490 --> 16:59.200
All set!

17:00.000 --> 17:02.780
Time for the bonus round...

17:04.420 --> 17:07.010
We'll strike the main enemy 
force in this night battle,

17:07.010 --> 17:09.130
and destroy their main carrier force!

17:09.130 --> 17:10.590
Of course!

17:12.550 --> 17:13.690
Right!

17:15.150 --> 17:18.490
This'll be our last attack, 
Torpedo Squadron 2.

17:24.020 --> 17:25.130
Let's go!

18:16.840 --> 18:17.900
Suzu!

18:21.850 --> 18:23.740
Ofuyu-san...

18:24.170 --> 18:25.440
Suzu...

18:31.960 --> 18:33.170
Yuki!

18:33.170 --> 18:34.630
I know!

18:56.370 --> 18:57.740
Shigure!

19:49.790 --> 19:54.920
<b><b>Sasebo Naval 
District</b></b>

19:54.010 --> 19:54.920
<i>Someday...</i>

19:57.040 --> 20:00.970
<i>Someday, I'll see you again...</i>

20:04.560 --> 20:07.880
<i>This time, someplace quiet and blue...</i>

20:11.720 --> 20:12.800
<i>Yes.</i>

20:15.100 --> 20:22.860
<i>On another quiet blue sea...</i>

22:36.500 --> 22:41.710
<b>Fusou Class Battleship "Yamashiro"</b>

22:36.500 --> 22:41.710
<b>Fusou Class Battleship "Fusou"</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:47.470
<b>Asashio Class Destroyer</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:47.470
<b>"Michishio"</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:47.470
<b>Asashio Class Destroyer</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:47.470
<b>"Yamagumo"</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:47.470
<b>Asashio Class Destroyer</b>

22:42.250 --> 22:47.470
<b>"Asagumo"</b>

22:48.010 --> 22:53.220
<b>Mogami Class Aviation Cruiser "Mogami"</b>

22:53.760 --> 22:58.980
<b>Kagerou Class Destroyer "Isokaze"</b>

22:53.760 --> 22:58.980
<b>Kagerou Class Destroyer "Hamakaze"</b>

22:59.560 --> 23:04.770
<b>Akatsuki Class Destroyer "Suzutsuki"</b>

22:59.560 --> 23:04.770
<b>Akatsuki Class Destroyer "Fuyutsuki"</b>

23:05.320 --> 23:10.530
<b>Yamato Class Battleship "Yamato"</b>

23:11.110 --> 23:16.330
<b>Agano Class Light Cruiser "Yahagi"</b>

23:16.870 --> 23:22.080
<b>Kagerou Class Destroyer "Yukikaze"</b>

23:22.630 --> 23:31.470
<b>Shiratsuyu Class Destroyer "Shigure"</b>

23:32.470 --> 23:39.560
<b>To all those who live now, in the future...</b>
